id: data-table
name: Data table card (extractable, scrolls on phones)
category: content
summary: A real comparison table inside a tonal card. Built to be read by people, screen readers and AI extractors.
requires: foundation
@@spec
- Card: surface-3, shape large-increased, horizontal scroll inside the card, never the page.
- Header cells Title Small on surface-variant tint, body cells Body Medium, numbers right-aligned with tabular numerals.
- Row dividers outline-variant, 56dp min row height (comfortable) or 40dp (dense, ticker data only).
- First column is the row header. A caption (visible or sr-only) names the table.
- Keep it a real <table>. Do not fake tables with divs: extractors and screen readers read the semantics.
- Always say the unit and the as-of date near the table (a footnote in Body Small).
@@a11y
- <caption>, <thead>, <th scope="col"> and <th scope="row"> for the first column.
- The scroll container is focusable (tabindex="0") with role="region" and an aria-label so keyboard users can scroll it.
- Do not encode meaning in color alone: pair a green/red change with a sign or arrow.
- Mirror important tables in JSON-LD (Dataset or a plain list) when the page is meant for AI extraction.
@@html
<div class="md-table-card" role="region" aria-label="Five-year returns" tabindex="0">
  <table class="md-table">
    <caption class="md-sr-only">Five-year price return by metal</caption>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th scope="col">Metal</th>
        <th scope="col" class="md-table__num">5-year return</th>
        <th scope="col" class="md-table__num">Volatility</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><th scope="row">Copper</th><td class="md-table__num">+51%</td><td class="md-table__num">22%</td></tr>
      <tr><th scope="row">Silver</th><td class="md-table__num">+88%</td><td class="md-table__num">35%</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
<p class="md-table-note">Price change only, in US dollars. Source and date go here.</p>
@@css
.md-table-card {
  overflow-x: auto;
  border-radius: var(--shape-lg-inc);
  background: var(--md-surface-3);
  color: var(--md-on-surface);
}

.md-table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-size: var(--md-type-body-medium-size);
  line-height: var(--md-type-body-medium-line);
  letter-spacing: var(--md-type-body-medium-tracking);
}

.md-table th,
.md-table td {
  min-height: 3.5rem;
  padding: var(--sp-md) var(--sp-lg);
  border-bottom: 0.0625rem solid var(--md-outline-variant);
  text-align: start;
  vertical-align: middle;
}

.md-table thead th {
  background: var(--md-surface-variant);
  color: var(--md-on-surface-variant);
  font-size: var(--md-type-title-small-size);
  font-weight: var(--md-type-title-small-weight);
  letter-spacing: var(--md-type-title-small-tracking);
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.md-table tbody th { font-weight: 500; }
.md-table tbody tr:last-child > * { border-bottom: 0; }
.md-table tbody tr:hover { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--md-on-surface) 8%, transparent); }

.md-table .md-table__num { text-align: end; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

.md-table-note {
  margin: var(--sp-sm) var(--sp-lg) 0;
  color: var(--md-on-surface-variant);
  font-size: var(--md-type-body-small-size);
  line-height: var(--md-type-body-small-line);
  letter-spacing: var(--md-type-body-small-tracking);
}
